  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Elders to Restore Traditional Wisdom for Peace, Healing, and Community Reconciliation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is part of the EU CSF Plus Programme titled &#x201c;Strengthening the Capacities of Grassroots CSOs in Ethiopia.&#x201d; It aims to contribute to sustained peace and community-based resilience in Raya Chercher and Raya Azebo, Tigray, by strengthening inclusive, community-led peacebuilding systems&#x2014;enabling elders (Abo Gereb), women&#x2019;s networks, and youth to jointly prevent conflict, resolve disputes, promote reconciliation, and advance youth empowerment for sustainable peace in the region.
Specific Objectives:
Strengthening existing peacebuilding leadership capacities
Revitalize and institutionalize existing traditional peace mechanisms
Strengthening social cohesion, cross-border trust, and youth resilience
Institutionalize inclusive peace governance and participation</narrative>
  </description>
